Borno: Territorial Evolution, 1890, 1893 and 1898 maps — Vincent Hiribarren.
Source: https://vincenthiribarren.com/borno/maps/index.html
Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The World History Atlas adapts the source by extracting the dark Borno core,
filling small text/river interruptions, tracing raster edges, and approximately
aligning them to the source graticule. Surrounding lighter districts and treaty
lines are omitted. The adaptations are not surveyed borders; the source author
explicitly describes the maps as approximate reconstructions of European views.
